  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Poisonous Cursed Energy</em></p>\n<p>You have learned to refine your poisons within Moon Dregs to create powerful mixtures. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><em>Moon Dregs</em> deals an additional 1d6 poison damage on a hit. This increases to 2d6 at 6th level and 3d8 at 11th level.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A creature grappled by <em>Moon Dregs</em> takes 2d4 poison damage at the beginning of their turn. This increases to 2d8 poison damage at 11th level.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Poison can also be used as an enhancer. You gain 4 ability points you can use to increase <em>Moon Dregs</em> ability scores (max of 20).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
